source: crates/daemon/tests/integration/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Set a scoped default signature

Usage: mxr signatures default [OPTIONS] <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>  Signature name

Options:
      --kind <KIND>        Which compose kind this default applies to [default: all] [possible values: all, new, reply]
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Account selector (key, name, email, or id). Omit for global default
      --from <FROM_EMAIL>  Exact from-address default within the account
  -h, --help               Print help
